                <p>Translator’s Note: The word in the third sentence which has been translated above
                    as “define” (<hi rendition="#italic">definan</hi>) can mean either “define” or
                    “decide”. The former is the primary meaning. [Footnote in the file
                    translation.]</p>
            </note>
